{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7a607ac2-6604-827d-95cf-d74e0e2c84dc",
  "created_at": "2025-12-15T12:04:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Mike Sullivan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:01:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:01:45-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Lorraine, Mike Sullivan here. Sorry, I'm on my cell and the reception is spotty where I'm standing. I just got done walking the dog, and I'm on my lunch break, and I looked up and, uh, there's a streetlight on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:02:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A streetlight that's on, and it's the middle of the day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:02:05-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, exactly. It's been on all day. I noticed it this morning around seven when it was still kind of dark, figured that was normal, but it's noon now and it's still going. [line breaks up] it stays on all day, I think even yesterday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:02:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up on me for a second. You said it's been on all day, and maybe yesterday too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:02:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, yesterday afternoon too, I'm pretty sure. I moved here from Connecticut about a year ago, and I really like it, so I figured I'd say something instead of letting it burn."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:02:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, we appreciate that. Can you give me the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:02:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's right in front of 322 Pelham Street. The pole's by the curb, kind of [inaudible] the front of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:02:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, it's right in front of what? The line cut out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:03:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "322 Pelham Street. Historic Hill. The pole is at the curb out front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:03:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Three twenty-two Pelham Street, the light by the curb in front, on during the day, since at least yesterday. Is there anything odd about the pole itself, like leaning, or a box open?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:03:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nothing I can see. Looks normal. But could you get a crew to check the pole? Maybe it's the sensor or something, I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:03:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll put in a request for a crew to look at the pole and the light. Do you want a call back, or is that all you need?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:03:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, you can reach me at 401-555-0179."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:03:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven nine. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:03:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:03:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, Mr. Sullivan, it's in. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:03:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thanks, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:03:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Enjoy the rest of your lunch."
    }
  ],
